              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 12:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’a m’uyio rwonglembe mwa? man bot Yehova nyuthre ni ng’a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum edongo i wang’e calu girapidha ma ng’ic, man calu ulag piny kud i ng’om m’uthwo: kite kadi berone de mbe; man kinde ma wanene, bero moko mbe ma nia wayenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhanu caye, man gikwere; en e dhanu mi can, man eng’io ku masendi: man jucaye calu ng’atu ma dhanu panu wang’gi ni kume; e wakwane ni gin moko ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
